{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 0.91, "end": 6.47, "text": "The chef, Julia Ning, of Station 5 Table and Bar in South Miami,"}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 6.71, "end": 9.93, "text": "a new American-style restaurant with some international flair."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 10.23, "end": 16.29, "text": "I wanted to bring all of these soulful, traditional dishes and unite them in one place."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 16.53, "end": 17.79, "text": "It's kind of like your home away from home."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 18.07, "end": 20.57, "text": "It's got food that's comfortable and interesting."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 20.91, "end": 23.45, "text": "Station 5 serves dinner Tuesday through Sunday,"}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 23.91, "end": 27.13, "text": "with lunch on Thursdays and Friday and brunch on the weekends."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 27.35, "end": 30.63, "text": "And any time is good for the dish we're making today."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 31.17, "end": 31.81, "text": "Croque Monsieur."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 32.31, "end": 33.51, "text": "It's very, very indulgent."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 33.73, "end": 37.13, "text": "It definitely would satisfy the hungry man in all of us."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 38.09, "end": 41.11, "text": "First, Chef Julia makes a bechamel sauce."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 41.61, "end": 43.99, "text": "In a hot pot, add butter and let it melt."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 44.21, "end": 46.03, "text": "Then add flour and stir."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 46.53, "end": 47.73, "text": "We're going to let that toast."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 48.69, "end": 52.29, "text": "Now add whole milk, kosher salt, blend, and simmer."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 52.89, "end": 55.09, "text": "Simmer several minutes, and when it starts to thicken,"}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 55.09, "end": 58.09, "text": "add grated Parmesan and Gruyere cheeses."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 58.75, "end": 60.89, "text": "When they melt, set aside on low heat."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 61.41, "end": 67.41, "text": "Next, put butter on the grill and toast slices of sourdough bread and black forest ham."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 67.41, "end": 69.41, "text": "I personally like to grill my ham."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 69.41, "end": 71.41, "text": "We're going to do that, too."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 71.41, "end": 75.41, "text": "Add more Gruyere on the ham and some Dijon mustard on the bread."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 75.41, "end": 79.41, "text": "Now put the ham on the bread and top it with the bechamel sauce."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 79.41, "end": 81.91, "text": "This is not a sandwich for the faint of heart."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 81.91, "end": 85.91, "text": "Pop it in the oven under the broiler for a couple of minutes to toast the cheese."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 85.91, "end": 89.91, "text": "When it's ready, plate with French fries, the Croque Monsieur sandwich,"}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 89.91, "end": 90.91, "text": "and some homemade Parmesan cheese."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 90.91, "end": 91.41, "text": "Ketchup."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 91.41, "end": 92.41, "text": "Tres bon."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 93.41, "end": 96.41, "text": "With our Croque Monsieur, we suggest having a fresh mimosa."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 99.24, "end": 100.74, "text": "Welcome to Station 5 Table and Bar."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 100.74, "end": 101.74, "text": "This is our Croque Monsieur."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 101.74, "end": 102.24, "text": "Enjoy."}
{"video_id": "4Zl5NvXPi-0", "start": 102.24, "end": 103.24, "text": "."}
